# The build backend of ltx-core and ltx-pipelines (their pyproject.toml: uv_build>=0.9.8,<0.10), so the Dockerfile builds
# both from the pinned commit without an unpinned build environment.
uv-build==0.9.30
# ComfyUI's kernel library (Apache-2.0), for the INT8 convrot files of B-243: W8A8 on torch._int_mm, a wheel without
# dependencies.
comfy-kitchen==0.2.41
# NATTEN with its CUDA kernels (B-266) for the diffusion decoder's neighborhood attention, the backend upstream's
# natten extra installs (packages/ltx-core/pyproject.toml); without it the decode falls back to Triton. Upstream pins
# the build for CUDA 13.2, this is the same release built for torch 2.13.0 and CUDA 13.0, the driver's
# (https://natten.org/install/, read on 23 Nov 2026). Added to the lock by hand; PyPI has 0.21.7 only as source, which
# builds libnatten only with the CUDA toolkit's compiler.
natten @ https://github.com/SHI-Labs/NATTEN/releases/download/v0.21.7/natten-0.21.7%2Btorch2130cu130-cp312-cp312-linux_x86_64.whl
ltx-core @ git+https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2@f0f2f8607189c78a72420b2b63cb1975b5eca179#subdirectory=packages/ltx-core
ltx-pipelines @ git+https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2@f0f2f8607189c78a72420b2b63cb1975b5eca179#subdirectory=packages/ltx-pipelines
